im]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Backlog batch B5: external sidecar validation, continuation [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]obligations, reinstall overrides, and core Clippy[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Resolve bob-cli-dg, bob-cli-dh, bob-cli-di, and bob-cli-dn with [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]reproducible verification, then continue the bounded backlog chain.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]backlog_batch_b5.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/backlog_batch_b5.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/backlog_batch_b4.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-dp[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-dp/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provision the isolated plans sidecar for external SASE [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]validation[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]external-plans-sidecar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]external-plans-sidecar: resolve bob-cli-dg in sase by fixing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]external-checkout plan-links validation (invalid-root for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase/repos/plans). Provision the correct isolated sidecars via sase repo[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open or validate against an explicitly resolved read context; never [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]silence validation or read another workspace. Verify with sase validate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in a clean external checkout and the governed sase tool run check. Use [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase validate or sase plan links validate, not the shorthand sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validate plan-links.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Clear the 27 pre-existing Clippy errors on the [/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]collision-policy base[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-clippy-cleanup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-clippy-cleanup: resolve bob-cli-dh in gh:sase-org/sase-core by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reproducing via sase tool run check in an opened core checkout, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recording toolchain and exact diagnostics, repairing only still-present [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]violations (agent_hold, bead/cli/tests, bead/touch_index, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]macro_catalog/tests, artifact_ref_commit_budget, gateway/push, macro_lsp[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests), and verifying with sase tool run check. Do not run check-full. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Close as superseded with evidence if the current toolchain no longer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reproduces.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Forward Justfile overrides through the editable reinstall[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editable-reinstall-overrides[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editable-reinstall-overrides: resolve bob-cli-di in sase Justfile [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]_install-venv/_setup/_core-overrides-arg by forwarding the effective [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]venv_dir/sase_core_dir settings (or binding the actual local wheel) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the nested just _core-overrides-arg call used in editable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reinstalls, preserving normal published-pin resolution when no local [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]core is requested. Regression-test both source (SASE_CORE_DIR) and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]SASE_CORE_WHEEL paths. Verify the installed wheel provenance/version [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before interpreting test results.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Carry opened-repo obligations across monitor continuations[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]continuation-obligations[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]continuation-obligations: resolve bob-cli-dn in sase host finalizer by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributing sase repo open events to the continuation agent (not only [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the predecessor) so finalizer_baseline opened_repo scope reaches the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]final context obligations. Reproduce by opening an external repo, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]editing it, handing off via sase monitor, and letting the continuation [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]declare; the continuation must commit the external edits. Reopen every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]external repo in each continuation to keep obligations visible. Verify [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the stranded-diff evidence pattern (finalizer context, baseline, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit results).[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-dp","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-dp.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-8dcc1447d8b41070d41a191de1d8d097","started_at":"2026-10-28T15:27:44.095732+00:00","state":"failed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"c1983650cfcbe804b8aef572c8dba1c455a7f13b3048cbc378b9112787e07aef","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-dp.1--code/chat.md","size_bytes":5117},"commits":{"digest":"afc45cfafcf658bd53a5b5c313b56673d140990fcb340dd46d595d3e6f8421e6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-dp.1--code/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93b